# Rotation and named paper (reference/components/document.md, reference/common/layers-and-rotation.md, reference/common/breaks.md and reference/common/overflow.md).
#
# Paper: A6 landscape: 148 × 105 mm, 419.53 × 297.64 pt. Page area of 379.53 × 257.64 from (20, 20); it ends at
# y = 277.64.
# The rotation of a positioned element only changes the painting: its Rect values are those of the unrotated boxes.
# A rotated box in flow takes up the rectangle that encloses it: that is its Rect.
#   tag (Overlay):   Offset 20 0 auto auto, 80 × 20: x = 20 + 379.53 − 80 = 319.53, y = 20 + 20 = 40.
#                     Rotated 45 degrees around its center (359.53, 50), it is enclosed by a square of
#                     (80 + 20) × cos 45 = 70.7: from y = 14.6 to 85.4 and from x = 324.2 to 394.9; it fits.
#   intro:            the first block of the flow, 379.53 × 150 at (20, 20).
#   stamp (Frame): 120 × 60 at (20, 170), rotated −8 around its center (80, 200): it is
#                     enclosed from x = 16.4 to 143.6 and from y = 161.9 to 238.1; it fits.
#   big (Frame):   rotated 180, it measures 40 + 50 = 90 and on page 1 there remain 277.64 − 230 = 47.64. Unrotated
#                     it would be split between b1 (40, which fits) and b2; rotated it is not split and moves whole to
#                     page 2: (20, 20), with b1 at y = 20 and b2 at y = 60.
#   badge (Image):    test/square.png, 30 × 30, rotated 45 around its center: in flow after big, it takes up the
#                     square that encloses it, 30 × √2 = 42.43 per side, at (20, 110).
#   side (Page overlay):     vertical text in the left margin, on both pages. Offset 229 auto auto −17:
#                     x = 20 − 17 = 3, y = 20 + 229 = 249; 200 × 14. Rotated −90 around its top left
#                     corner, it rises from y = 249 to 49 and takes up from x = 3 to 17.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Paper: A6
		Orientation: landscape
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
	Section:
		Overlay:
			Id: tag
			Offset: 20 0 auto auto
			Rotate: 45
			Box:
				Width: 80
				Height: 20
				Padding: 4 0
				Background: #C0392B
			Text: Novedad
				Typography:
					Bold: true
					Align: center
					Color: #FFFFFF
		Block:
			Id: intro
			Box:
				Height: 150
				Padding: 12 110 12 12
				Background: #F2EFE8
			Text: Una caja girada ocupa su sitio sin girar: el sello de abajo no mueve el bloque que lo sigue.
		Frame:
			Id: stamp
			Rotate: -8
			Box:
				Width: 120
				Height: 60
				Border: 2
				Border color: #C0392B
				Padding: 21 12
				Corner radius: 4
			Text: Aprobado
				Typography:
					Bold: true
					Align: center
					Color: #C0392B
					Case: uppercase
		Frame:
			Id: big
			Rotate: 180
			Block:
				Id: b1
				Box:
					Height: 40
					Background: #D6E4F0
				Text: Primera parte (girada 180 grados)
			Block:
				Id: b2
				Box:
					Height: 50
					Background: #A9C6E0
				Text: Segunda parte
		Image: test/square.png
			Id: badge
			Rotate: 45
		Page overlay:
			Id: side
			Offset: 229 auto auto -17
			Rotate: -90
			Rotate origin: top left
			Box:
				Width: 200
				Height: 14
			Text: Certificado n.º 2026-0147
				Typography:
					Size: 8
					Color: #7F8C8D
